Subject: [PATCH] media: persist track choices independently of discovered files

Keep discovered file records intact while saving an explicit subtitle or
soundtrack selection. Commit selections and external file edits together.
Use dedicated metadata types, preserve the IMedia vtable, and distinguish
an empty selection from discovery defaults. Cover managed tracks, rollback,
independent categories, restart persistence and URI serialization.

